# QUALIFICATION: real coverage ledger for graphlaw v26.9.29 (every op and native module).
@prefix gac: <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/graphlaw-ash-capability#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# Op identity stubs (same IRIs and opName triples as the registry consumer graph) so the ledger is
# self-checkable by gate 180 when loaded alone; merging with the registry adds no new subjects.
